.TH OROC-PUSH 1 "" "Oro Runtime 0.1.8" "Oro Runtime Manual"
.SH NAME
oroc\-push \- Local UnifiedPush development tooling.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
oroc push <command> [options]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Local UnifiedPush development tooling.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBserver\fR
run a local ntfy server for an Android UnifiedPush distributor
.TP
\fBdistributor\fR
build or install the Oro Kotlin development distributor APK
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
show help
.SH NOTES
.PP
Run 'oroc push server \-\-help' for configuration and HTTPS requirements.
.SH SEE ALSO
oroc(1)
